{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35153","headline":"诗品二十四则 绮丽 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 绮丽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神存富贵，始轻黄金。\n浓尽必枯，浅者屡深。\n露余山青，红杏在林。\n月明华屋，画桥碧阴。\n金尊酒满，共客弹琴。\n取之自足，良殚美襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}